.bin/
.ebitenmcp/

# What `ebitenmcp call` writes when --out is left at the working directory. It
# is named after the tool, so the pattern has to be, or the next one lands in a
# commit the way game_record-0.png did.
game_*-[0-9].png
game_*-[0-9].gif
game_*-[0-9].mp4

# The binaries `go build ./...` drops in the working directory, which is how
# 26 MB of them — a Mach-O and a PE32+, from checking that this cross-compiles —
# ended up in the history and had to be filtered back out. Anchored to the root
# so that the cmd/ebitenmcp directory is still tracked.
/ebitenmcp
/ebitenmcp.exe
